#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_physics_validation.ipynb:10002
#: 0572b87ca9ba48eaafef5510695edb3d
msgid "Physical Validity Checking: Units, Floors, and Sanity Tests"
msgstr "物理妥当性検証：単位・数値床・健全性テスト"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_physics_validation.ipynb:10004
#: 748d76e1e71c46ca8423b198b9221280
msgid ""
"One of gwexpy's design principles is **numerical safety for GW-scale "
"quantities**.  Gravitational-wave strain is ~10⁻²³ — close to the limits of "
"double-precision floating point — so naive computations can silently produce"
" wrong answers."
msgstr ""
"gwexpy の設計原則の一つは **GW スケール量に対する数値的安全性**です。重力波のひずみは ~10⁻²³ "
"であり、倍精度浮動小数点の限界に近いため、素朴な計算は誤った答えを静かに生成しかねません。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_physics_validation.ipynb:10009
#: bae987a23b874707988464b498776b1c
msgid ""
"gwexpy provides `gwexpy.numerics.constants` and `gwexpy.numerics.scaling` to"
" handle:"
msgstr ""
"gwexpy は次に対応するために `gwexpy.numerics.constants` と `gwexpy.numerics.scaling` "
"を提供します："

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_physics_validation.ipynb:10011
#: 38058341865d46108e8f6ea7dcc3f449
msgid "**Numerical floors** that prevent log(0) and division-by-zero"
msgstr "log(0) やゼロ除算を防ぐ**数値フロア**"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_physics_validation.ipynb:10012
#: eef7f0781fee4b0fb470e77da0277881
msgid "**Dtype-aware epsilons** that adapt to float32 / float64"
msgstr "float32 / float64 に適応する **dtype を考慮したイプシロン**"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_physics_validation.ipynb:10013
#: 7a34209407734ed1b67a5eed09904d1b
msgid "**Safe log-scale visualisation** with a physical dynamic range"
msgstr "物理的なダイナミックレンジを持つ**安全な対数スケール可視化**"

